14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          本批次采收时间：2020.7\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          到港时间：2020.10\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           风味特征：葡萄，桃子，西柚\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: justify;text-indent: 8px;max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-family:Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 2px;\">\n           Grape, Peach, Grapefruit\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;'>\n          冲煮参数：\n         </span>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;'>\n          中细的研磨度，粉水比1:14-1:15 （18g/270g），水温92-93，3次注水（40/130/100），总冲煮时间2分-2分半\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: left;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.543999969959259px;'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SOeZKOcr0uFiajNKsP2jkN8Mic0dt1HdpaduQ8uZbFICedVjjGIBPEQoDGQ5k7u0ziaN79elx2UwuHA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;width: 574px;visibility: visible !important;height: 449px;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          【庄园介绍】\n         </span>\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 32px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Leonel的帕拉多庄园位于著名的粉红波旁产区：圣奥古斯汀的橙村。这里以出产高品质的粉红波旁而闻名。我们在2019年4月到这里寻找高品质的粉红波旁。刚到橙村就被当地热情洋溢的咖农和甘蔗农载歌载舞地欢迎，很是热闹。在来这里之前我就听说这里长期受到中间商收购价格下压的困扰，他们的收入水平得不到保障，因此他们想要找到更直接的生豆买家，因此邀请到我来做客。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 32px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          到场有两百余名种植咖啡和其他农作物的农民，他们都为我这个似乎看起来很特别的客人鼓掌欢迎，当时心里还是有不少压力的，但也很受感动。我向他们讲述了现在中国精品咖啡市场的情况，并在之后和他们深入交流。我们鼓励他们在当地成立自己的合作社，并提高咖啡品质来获得更高溢价。我们在此行中得到很多粉波旁的样品，并在之后马上进行了杯测。其中一支被选中的优秀的日晒批次就来自Leonel的帕拉多庄园。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 32px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;text-indent: 8px;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Leonel采收全熟的粉红波旁鲜果，由于粉红波旁特殊的颜色，要采收全熟果变得难度很高，采收后会根据密度进行浮选，洗净，然后放在袋中静置一夜。第二天移至晾晒架上完成20日左右的晾晒，在此过程中每两小时翻动一次。\n          <br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/PWcq5eyxUTlO3QeIIgMuhgG1luoMrcueYawK2Sqib74icYex7I37JibqIDwchWR7CqI9drI6rYC9XjF9xfcKK2uaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"background-color: rgb(238, 237, 235);border: 1px solid rgb(238, 237, 235);background-size: 22px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;height: 453.75px !important;width: 605px !important;background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 32px;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br style=\"max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"max-width: 100%;min-height: 1em;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SOeZKOcr0uFiajNKsP2jkN8bX9nk1ib4vP4EpkCpO5SOJgNHgpCBbDWpClRJAMoWq6t6RxJANPah9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"background-color: rgb(238, 237, 235);border: 1px solid rgb(238, 237, 235);background-size: 22px;height: 585px;width: 574px;box-sizing: border-box !important;word-wrap: break-word !important;background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat no-repeat;\"/>\n</sec